{"answer":null,"company_tags":[],"concept_id":"attention-quadratic-complexity","content_sha256":"sha256:347a2f1e61c33bc12b362c731695e7f2377a1d23f54917faff364c10c255f167","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789959334.16645,"domain":"model-architecture","explanation":"每个 token 都要与所有 token 算相似度,注意力矩阵是 n×n,时间与激活显存均为 O(n^2)。这正是各类稀疏/线性注意力想优化的对象。","id":"q-arch-mag6-attn-quadratic-002","options":[{"id":"a","text":"O(n^2):需要计算 n×n 的注意力矩阵,长度翻倍则计算和中间显存约变为 4 倍,因此长上下文代价急剧上升"},{"id":"b","text":"O(n):与长度线性相关,长文本几乎没有额外代价"},{"id":"c","text":"O(log n):对数级,可忽略"},{"id":"d","text":"O(1):与序列长度无关"}],"prompt":"标准自注意力相对序列长度 n 的计算/显存复杂度是多少?这为什么成为长文本的瓶颈?","review_state":null,"rubric":null,"schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"tradeoff","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"Attention Is All You Need","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"attention","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
